---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
	title="Pricing"
	description="Simple monthly pricing for pottery studios of every size. Starter, Studio and Collective plans, all with a 30-day free trial."
>
	<section class="band-dark page-hero">
		<div class="wrap">
			<p class="eyebrow">Pricing</p>
			<h1>Pricing that grows with your studio</h1>
			<p class="lede narrow">
				Every plan includes unlimited classes, online payments and text reminders. Prices in USD,
				billed monthly. Save two months when you pay yearly.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="wrap section">
		<div class="plans">
			<div class="plan">
				<h2>Starter</h2>
				<p class="price">$29<span>/month</span></p>
				<p class="muted">For a home studio or a shared garage setup.</p>
				<ul>
					<li>1 kiln</li>
					<li>Up to 150 members</li>
					<li>Class and drop-in booking</li>
					<li>Firing fees by cubic inch</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<div class="plan featured">
				<h2>Studio</h2>
				<p class="price">$79<span>/month</span></p>
				<p class="muted">Our most popular plan for community studios.</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Up to 3 kilns</li>
					<li>Unlimited members</li>
					<li>Wheel and table reservations</li>
					<li>Class packs, waitlists and memberships</li>
					<li>Pickup texts when pieces come out of the kiln</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<div class="plan">
				<h2>Collective</h2>
				<p class="price">$149<span>/month</span></p>
				<p class="muted">For studios with more than one location.</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Unlimited kilns</li>
					<li>Multiple locations, one member account</li>
					<li>Staff roles and shift notes</li>
					<li>Priority support from a real potter</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>

		<p class="muted small">
			Card payments are processed by Stripe at their standard rate. Kilnbook does not add a booking
			fee on top.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="wrap section narrow">
		<h2>Questions studios ask</h2>
		<dl class="faq">
			<dt>How does the free trial work?</dt>
			<dd>
				You get 30 days on the Studio plan with no card. At the end you pick a plan or your account
				pauses. Nothing is deleted.
			</dd>
			<dt>Can I import my members from a spreadsheet?</dt>
			<dd>
				Yes. Upload a CSV with names, emails and remaining class credits, and we map the columns for
				you during setup.
			</dd>
			<dt>What happens if I add a fourth kiln?</dt>
			<dd>
				You can move from Studio to Collective at any point in the month. We prorate the difference
				on your next invoice.
			</dd>
			<dt>Do you offer nonprofit pricing?</dt>
			<dd>
				Registered nonprofits and school ceramics programs get 30% off any plan. Mention it when you
				book a demo.
			</dd>
		</dl>
		<p>
			Still deciding? Read the <a href="/help/billing">billing FAQ</a> or
			<a href="/contact">talk to us</a>.
		</p>
		<p>
			Weighing up a general booking tool? See
			<a href="/compare/kilnbook-vs-mindbody">how Kilnbook compares with Mindbody</a>.
		</p>
	</section>
</Base>
